### Public health
GET http://localhost:8080/api/public/health

### Login USER (replace password)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "challenge-user",
  "password": "{{userPassword}}"
}

### Secured hello (replace token)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/secured/hello
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### Admin endpoint with admin token
GET http://localhost:8080/api/secured/admin
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
